    "body": "Whether the problem appears or not seems to depend on exactly where the right edge of the terminal is compared to the prompt. So this is fine:\r\n![Screenshot 2022-03-31 at 16 28 03](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/216826/161092539-039be966-5516-4f9b-9cf8-65af6c058b38.png)\r\n\r\nbut one column wider:\r\n![Screenshot 2022-03-31 at 16 29 23](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/216826/161092754-35462921-0238-491c-8c25-c006c5724b70.png)\r\n\r\none more column wider:\r\n![Screenshot 2022-03-31 at 16 30 04](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/216826/161092910-2a055ba6-717a-4e9c-9afc-be48b223f20e.png)\r\n\r\ntwo more columns on top of that:\r\n![Screenshot 2022-03-31 at 16 30 56](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/216826/161093057-544d0b12-5e9d-4619-897f-fee335a42d7b.png)\r\n\r\nI wonder if a line break or something is being inserted in the middle of an escape sequence.",
